OL,3,AUS central bank raises interest rates
OL,4,Afor first time in three years
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe US central bank raises interest
OL,7,Frates for the first time in three years
OL,8,Ffrom 3.5%-3.75% to 3.75%-4%
OL,10,F"The plain fact is inflation is too
OL,11,Fhigh, and has been for too long," Fed
OL,12,Fchairman Kevin Warsh says
OL,14,FThe Fed has been seeking to curb rising
OL,15,Fprices as the Iran war pushes up global
OL,16,Foil prices, which have hit American
OL,17,Fconsumers
OL,23,APub: 16-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
