OL,3,AUS central bank raises interest rates
OL,4,Afor first time in three years
OL,5,
OL,6,FWhat are interest rates? They set the
OL,7,Fcost of borrowing money, and influence
OL,8,Fmortgages, loans and savings but can
OL,9,Falso boost returns on savings. Central
OL,10,Fbanks often hike up rates when they
OL,11,Fthink inflation is too high
